	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 13th level, your fey’s tricksy nature expands notably. They may now use any martial maneuver they are trained in from 10ft away. Choose a square within 10ft for the martial maneuver to emanate from. When using martial maneuvers in situations of cover and concealment, treat the square you have chosen, rather than the square your fey occupies, to determine cover or concealment for the purposes of the martial maneuver.</p>",
